<title>UK: SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and latest</p>
<p>positions in the best-of-19-frames first round of the world</p>
<p>professional snooker championship on Monday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>9-Darren Morgan (Wales) beat Gary Wilkinson (England) 10-5</p>
<p>10-Steve Davis (England) beat David McLellan (Scotland) 10-2</p>
<p>8-Ronnie O'Sullivan (England) beat Mick Price (England) 10-6</p>
<p>Billy Snaddon (Scotland) leads 6-Alan McManus (Scotland 5-3</p>
</text>
